<title>GERMANY: TENNIS-STUTTGART OPEN THIRD ROUND RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-STUTTGART OPEN THIRD ROUND RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>STUTTGART, Germany 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Third-round results at</p>
<p>the $2.2 million Stuttgart Open tennis tournament on Thursday</p>
<p>(prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Magnus Gustafsson (Sweden) beat Mark Woodforde (Australia) 6-7</p>
<p>(3-7) 6-2 7-6 (7-4)</p>
<p>6-Boris Becker (Germany) beat 12-Thomas Enqvist (Sweden) 6-4</p>
<p>7-5</p>
<p>9-Andre Agassi (U.S.) beat Richey Reneberg (U.S.) 6-4 6-2</p>
<p>Jan Siemerink (Netherlands) beat Renzo Furlan (Italy) 6-4 6-4</p>
<p>5-Goran Ivanisevic beat 11-Todd Martin (U.S.) 6-2 6-4</p>
<p>1-Pete Sampras (U.S.) beat 16-Felix Mantilla (Spain) 6-1 6-4</p>
<p>10-Marcelo Rios (Chile) beat 8-Richard Krajicek (Netherlands)</p>
<p>6-4 6-1</p>
<p>2-Michael Chang (U.S.) beat 15-Jim Courier (U.S.) 7-5 6-2</p>
</text>
